HTTrack 3.50.1: new engine, crashes fixed.

• Fixed crashes: project name with a slash, rotation, large log
• Long crawls no longer freeze the progress screen
• Updating no longer keeps a stale page or drops a saved file
• JavaScript and stylesheets in mirrors no longer break
• A visited page can no longer make HTTrack send a file from your phone
• Stop then Continue resumes part-downloaded files

Files part-downloaded before this update start again. Saved files stay.